[USB]   companion probe   (one-shot manual BLE probe)
[USB]   companion enrich  (manual enrichment; probes first if needed)
[USB]   companion cancel  (clear all pending companion requests)
[USB]   time | time sync   (clock status; 'sync' forces NTP now)
[USB]   heap status      (internal/PSRAM heap snapshot)
[USB]   entity status    (PSRAM Entity working-set summary)
[USB]   spool audit       (read-only spool scan, prints mismatches)
[USB]   spool count       (exact total record count + spool stats)
[USB]   spool enrich      (pending vs already enriched counts)
[USB]   spool repair      (audit + repair counters, quarantine bad segs)
[USB]   spool diag        (segment list, counters, flags)
[USB]   spool quarantine list  (list /spool_bad files)
[USB]   spool quarantine meta  (print quarantine JSON records)
[USB]   spool quarantine clear (delete all quarantine files)
[USB]   fieldvault dump    (print FieldVault records, keep them)
[USB]   fieldvault clear   (delete retained FieldVault records)
[USB]   fieldvault upload  (upload pending FieldVault records only)
[USB]   crash log         (print retained crash breadcrumb ring)
[USB]   ble rxdiag        (print retained BLE receive crash stage)
[USB]   upload now         (manual MQTT upload of pending records)
[USB]   upload stop        (safely stop the active MQTT upload)
[USB]   upload resume      (allow MQTT uploads again)
[USB]   upload rewind [id] (re-offer uploaded records; 0/blank = all)
[USB]   mesh status        (Meshtastic client state + counters)
[USB]   mesh on | mesh off (take/release SX1262 for Meshtastic)
[USB]   mesh nodes         (list heard mesh nodes)
[USB]   mesh send <text>   (broadcast a text message)
[USB]   ble smoke         (suspend WiFi, init/deinit NimBLE, resume promisc)
